<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave B — support BodyPartDefs/BodyPartGroupDefs.

  Ported verbatim from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's Bodies/BodyParts_StarWars.xml
  (the WHOLE file, not just this wave's own needs — it is small, self-contained, and
  every defName gets a flat RSW_ prefix, matching the sound-wave convention
  (mlie_sound_defname_map.json) and Wave A's creature renames. Porting the full file
  now means Wave C species that reuse these same tail/claw/horn/wing/tentacle parts
  (Rancor, Blixus, Beldon, Lylek, etc.) do not need this exercise repeated.

  Only RSW_SWTailAttackTool, RSW_SWLeftLegClawAttackTool, RSW_SWRightLegClawAttackTool,
  RSW_SWLeftFingerClaw and RSW_SWRightFingerClaw are used by this wave's own species
  (Dewback, Acklay, Wampa) — the rest sit ready for later waves. All tags used inside
  (MovingLimbDigit, ManipulationLimbDigit, MovingLimbCore, ManipulationLimbCore) are
  vanilla Core body-part tags; nothing here depends on the donor mod being present.
-->
